==Battleground==
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Koronium]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Berserkory]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shields]] are a go-to option for this stage, as every enemy here has [[Wave Attack]]s. [[Talents|Talented]] [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Dread Pirate Catley]] serves practical use here as he can knockback Berserkory and is [[Immune to Waves|Wave-immune]]. Another niche unit that can be used here is [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Million-Dollar Cat]] to kill the Koronium. [[Macho Crystal Cat]] can be used to push Kory behind Koronium to let you try to use your [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critters]] on Koronium.

